## Known Gotchas

[Service-specific quirks. Examples:]
- **`rescue => e; nil`** hides failures; rescue specific errors and re-raise or report. See `ruby-patterns.md §Errors`.
- **N+1 queries**: preload associations used in loops (`includes`).
- **`update_column` / `update_all`** skip validations and callbacks; avoid on money columns.
